Telecom Service & Network Management System

A production-oriented FastAPI backend for managing telecom customers,
service plans, SIM cards, devices, subscriptions, network
infrastructure, outages, support tickets, SLA tracking, notifications,
reports, audit logs, security, and performance.

Project Status

FastAPI backend: Levels 1--20 completed

Automated test suite: 351 passed, 115 warnings

Git repository: GitHub master branch

API documentation: Swagger UI / ReDoc

Database: SQLite by default, with SQLAlchemy ORM support for other
relational databases

Authentication: JWT-based access and refresh tokens

Authorization: Role-based access control

Key Features

JWT authentication and refresh tokens

Role-based authorization

Customer and KYC management

Customer address management

Service plan management

SIM card registration and lifecycle management

Device registration and lifecycle management

Subscription activation and management

Usage tracking for data, voice, and SMS

Network tower management

Network equipment management

Network outage management and affected-customer identification

Support ticket management

Ticket assignment to support agents / field technicians

SLA policies and SLA tracking

Service request management

In-app notification management

Operations dashboard

Advanced reports

Audit logging

CORS configuration

Security headers

Request IDs

In-memory rate limiting

Database performance indexes

Health and readiness endpoints

Unit and integration tests

