Environment Configuration

Copy the example environment file:

copy .env.example .env

Update the values in .env.

Example:

APP_NAME=Telecom Service & Network Management System
APP_VERSION=1.0.0
DEBUG=True

DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./telecom.db

JWT_SECRET_KEY=CHANGE_THIS_TO_A_LONG_RANDOM_SECRET
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256

ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=30
REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRE_DAYS=7
PASSWORD_RESET_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=15

Do not commit .env or real secrets to Git.

Installation

Create and activate a virtual environment.

Windows PowerShell

python -m venv venv
.\venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1

Install the required packages:

pip install fastapi uvicorn sqlalchemy pydantic-settings PyJWT pwdlib pytest httpx

For PostgreSQL, install a PostgreSQL driver as required by the selected
database configuration.

Run the Application

From the project root:

uvicorn app.main:app --reload

The application will normally be available at:

http://127.0.0.1:8000

API Documentation

Swagger UI

http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs

ReDoc

http://127.0.0.1:8000/redoc

Swagger provides interactive documentation for the implemented API
endpoints.

System Endpoints

Root

GET /

Health

GET /health

Readiness

GET /ready

The readiness endpoint checks database availability.

Testing

Run the complete test suite:

pytest -q

The completed Levels 1--20 test suite currently reports:

351 passed, 115 warnings

The warnings are non-blocking deprecation/runtime warnings observed
during the test run.

Security

The application includes:

JWT authentication

Access and refresh token handling

Password hashing

Role-based authorization

Request validation

CORS configuration

Security response headers

Content Security Policy

Request IDs

Rate limiting

Authentication endpoint rate limiting

Audit logging for state-changing requests

Protection against logging sensitive authentication data

Production deployments should use a strong random JWT secret and HTTPS.

Performance

Performance-related features include:

Indexed foreign-key and frequently queried fields

Composite indexes for audit logs

Composite indexes for usage queries

Composite indexes for outage queries

Composite indexes for support ticket queries

Composite indexes for ticket assignment queries

Database readiness checks

